   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>First of all thanks for a great tool. I have some queries.</div><div><br></div><div>I have BS (5hmc+5mc) and oxBS (5mc) data. I am trying to estimate true 5hmc and 5mc level.</div><div>Please have a look at commands. </div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><b style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"># BS (5hmc+5mc) data</b><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\">WT_bs_5mc_5hmc=methRead(&quot;methyl_call/WT_bs_CpG.txt&quot;,<a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231713825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HAiDjmMrY8sg5rnUQtQ7H\">sample.id</a>=&quot;WT_bs_5mc_5hmc&quot;,assembly=&quot;hg19&quot;) <b> </b><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><b style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"># oxBS (5mc) data</b><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\">WT_oxbs_5mc=methRead(&quot;methyl_call/WT_oxbs_CpG.txt&quot;,<a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231713825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HAiDjmMrY8sg5rnUQtQ7H\">sample.id</a>=&quot;WT_oxbs_5mc&quot;,assembly=&quot;hg19&quot;)      <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><u></u><br><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><u></u><b>I just want to confirm:</b><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><u></u><br><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><u></u><b># Below command will give me true 5hmc level? </b><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\">WT_adjusted_true_5hmC=adjustMethylC(WT_bs_5mc_5hmc , WT_oxbs_5mc)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><b># Below command will give me true 5mc level?</b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\">WT_adjusted_true_5mC=adjustMethylC(WT_oxbs_5mc,WT_bs_5mc_5hmc)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\">Also, Later I want to plot the average pattern of 5hmc and 5mc across promoter and gene-body regions. I know how to make average expression plots for ChIP/RNA seq but do you have any idea how to make them on BS and oxBS data? </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Consolas\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Thanks in advance, looking for a positive response. </font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Regards</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Adnan. </font></div>\r\n\r\n</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
