ve me true 5hmc level? </b><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Consolas\">WT_adjusted_true_5hmC=adjustMethylC(WT_bs_5mc_5hmc , WT_oxbs_5mc)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"> <br></p></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
