     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div>The first argument should be the compound measurement which includes both 5mC and 5hmC measurement. The second argument should be either true 5hmC or 5mC levels. These levels will be simply subtracted from the compound measurement. </div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/al2na/methylKit/blob/master/R/adjust.methylC.R#L99\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/al2na/methylKit/blob/master/R/adjust.methylC.R%23L99&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231713827000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Bw2WNo2mokt1ahGOPRYON\">https://github.com/al2na/methylKit/blob/master/R/adjust.methylC.R#L99</a><br></div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div>"
